# Configuration/Secrets (Crucial!)
# If your application.properties contains passwords or API keys,
# make sure this file is not committed. If it doesn't, you can omit this.
# If you use a secure application-dev.properties, you might want to commit the template.
# For safety, ensure sensitive files are ignored.
application*.properties
!application.properties # Allows the core file, but ignores variants if sensitive